            "pc_requirements": {
                "minimum": "<strong>Mínimos:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requer um sistema operativo e processador de 64 bits<br></li><li><strong>Sistema Operativo *:</strong> 64 bit Windows 10 / 8 / 7<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> Intel Core i5-2500K 3.3GHz / AMD FX-8150 3.6GHz or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 4 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> GeForce GTX 550 Ti / Radeon HD 6790 2GB VRAM*<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versão 11<br></li><li><strong>Rede:</strong> Ligação à Internet de banda larga<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 4 GB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Placa de som:</strong> DirectX compatible soundcard<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> * Laptop versions of graphics cards may work but are not officially supported. Steering wheels not supported.</li></ul>",
                "recommended": "<strong>Recomendados:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requer um sistema operativo e processador de 64 bits<br></li><li><strong>Sistema Operativo *:</strong> 64 bit Windows 10 / 8 / 7<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 3.2 GHz / AMD Ryzen 5 1600X 3.6GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 8 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> GeForce GTX 960 / Radeon HD 7950 3GB VRAM*<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versão 11<br></li><li><strong>Rede:</strong> Ligação à Internet de banda larga<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 4 GB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Placa de som:</strong> DirectX compatible soundcard<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> * Laptop versions of graphics cards may work but are not officially supported. Steering wheels not supported. Windows 7 and 8 support will be added during the Early Access stage of the project.</li></ul>"
